#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "148_Kiryu"
msgid "Well, I should probably get going."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "160_Date"
msgid "Be careful out there, Kiryu."
msgstr "Ten cuidado ahí fuera, Kiryu."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "172_Kiryu"
msgid "I will."
msgstr "Lo haré."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "208_Date"
msgid "What's the deal, Kiryu? Sounded like you came to some kind\\r\nof agreement?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "220_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah, I'm meeting him with the file on the roof of Kamurocho\\r\nHills. Tonight at ten... alone."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "232_Tanimura"
msgid "Alone!? But that's insane!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "244_Date"
msgid "You're not actually going through with that baloney, are\\r\nyou?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "256_Kiryu"
msgid "I have to. That's part of the deal."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "268_Kiryu"
msgid "Sounds like I'll be fighting through the entire Ueno Seiwa\\r\nClan to get up there, too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "280_Akiyama"
msgid "Guy doesn't take any chances once he gets down to business,\\r\nhuh? You sure you still wanna go?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "292_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm sure. There's no other way."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "304_Date"
msgid "You say that, but..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "316_Akiyama"
msgid "Let him go if he wants to go. Besides, I don't think\\r\nanything we say is gonna change his mind."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "328_Akiyama"
msgid "Isn't that right, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "340_Kiryu"
msgid "Right. A deal's a deal."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "412_Katsuragi"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "424_Kiryu"
msgid "You there, Katsuragi?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "436_Katsuragi"
msgid "You're not Tanimura."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "448_Kiryu"
msgid "My name's Kiryu. I needed to talk to you, so I'm borrowing\\r\nTanimura's phone for a bit."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "460_Katsuragi"
msgid "Kiryu? As in the Tojo Clan Fourth Chairman, Kazuma\\r\nKiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "472_Kiryu"
msgid "That's the one."
msgstr "Así es."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "484_Katsuragi"
msgid "Well, well, well. What a nice little surprise. So, what can\\r\nI do for you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "496_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm calling about Taiga and Yasuko Saejima."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "508_Katsuragi"
msgid "Oh? I don't know what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "520_Kiryu"
msgid "Drop the act. We know you took them from Purgatory."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "532_Katsuragi"
msgid "And what of it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "544_Kiryu"
msgid "I want to cut a deal with you. I have something you want\\r\nvery badly. I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "556_Katsuragi"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "568_Kiryu"
msgid "The file Hamazaki stole from Penitentiary No. 2 when he and\\r\nSaejima broke out."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "580_Kiryu"
msgid "I can't help but assume you want it back. But maybe I'm\\r\nwrong."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "592_Katsuragi"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "604_Kiryu"
msgid "Sounds like you don't want it after all. Let's just forget\\r\nthis ever happened. Later."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "616_Katsuragi"
msgid "Wait."
msgstr "Espera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "628_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "640_Katsuragi"
msgid "How did that file find its way into your hands?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "652_Kiryu"
msgid "Good question. Hamazaki gave it to me down in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "664_Katsuragi"
msgid "...And who knows about all this?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "676_Kiryu"
msgid "Besides me and Hamazaki, just a few others who are here with\\r\nme now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "688_Katsuragi"
msgid "Munakata is in the dark?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "700_Kiryu"
msgid "Munakata?"
msgstr "¿Munakata?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "712_Katsuragi"
msgid "Deputy commissioner of the Tokyo PD."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "724_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. I don't see how he'd know."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "736_Katsuragi"
msgid "...Good. Well? Let's hear what you want."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "748_Kiryu"
msgid "Taiga and Yasuko Saejima back safely. And the money Kido\\r\nstole from Sky Finance. Should be around a hundred billion."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "760_Katsuragi"
msgid "For a living yakuza legend, you make a piss poor negotiator.\\r\nYou're going to have to do better than that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "772_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "784_Katsuragi"
msgid "Negotiation is a psychological battle."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "796_Katsuragi"
msgid "If you can't entice the other party with terms that favor\\r\nthem, you may as well pack up and go home."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "808_Katsuragi"
msgid "You understand, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "820_Kiryu"
msgid "...Then what do you suggest?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "832_Katsuragi"
msgid "What indeed... How about this?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "844_Katsuragi"
msgid "You come alone to make the exchange."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "856_Kiryu"
msgid "Alone?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "868_Katsuragi"
msgid "You heard me. I'd like to see you bloodied and bruised by\\r\nthe time you arrive, as well."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "880_Kiryu"
msgid "What's that supposed to mean?"
msgstr "¿Qué se supone que significa eso?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "892_Katsuragi"
msgid "I'm going to have you jump through a little hoop for me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "904_Katsuragi"
msgid "See if this old dog can still do a few tricks."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "916_Kiryu"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "¿Qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "928_Katsuragi"
msgid "We'll make the exchange on the Kamurocho Hills roof."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "940_Katsuragi"
msgid "I'll be waiting there with Saejima, his sister, and the\\r\nhundred billion yen."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "952_Katsuragi"
msgid "All you'll need to do to reach the roof... is fight your way\\r\nthrough the entire Ueno Seiwa Clan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "964_Kiryu"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "976_Katsuragi"
msgid "You might make your way up to the roof. You might die in the\\r\nprocess."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "988_Katsuragi"
msgid "It doesn't matter much to me either way."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1000_Katsuragi"
msgid "Those are the terms I'd be willing to accept."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1012_Kiryu"
msgid "And if I make it up to the roof?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1024_Katsuragi"
msgid "Then we move forward with the transaction."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1036_Katsuragi"
msgid "And I'll be secure in the knowledge that you'll be far too\\r\nexhausted to kill me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1048_Katsuragi"
msgid "Even if you wanted to."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1060_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1072_Katsuragi"
msgid "This is just how it has to be, Kiryu-san. I plan to live a\\r\nlong, fulfilling life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1084_Katsuragi"
msgid "And taking my chances with monsters like you and Saejima...\\r\nWell, it would be nothing short of a fool's errand."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1096_Katsuragi"
msgid "Not all yakuza are like Nishikiyama or Ryuji Goda."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1108_Katsuragi"
msgid "Some of us would rather survive than die atop the hill of\\r\n\"honor\" and \"manliness.\""
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1120_Katsuragi"
msgid "So, do we have a deal?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1132_Kiryu"
msgid "Fine. I'll be there, just name the time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1144_Katsuragi"
msgid "Ten o'clock tonight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1156_Katsuragi"
msgid "I can only hope you still have a pulse by the time I see you\\r\nnext."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1168_Katsuragi"
msgid "Until then."
msgstr "Hasta entonces."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1228_Date"
msgid "How'd you end up with this thing, Kiryu?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1240_Kiryu"
msgid "Hamazaki gave it to me down in Okinawa. It's a document\\r\nshowing the creation of Penitentiary No. 2, and the expected\\r\nflow of money into the place."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1252_Akiyama"
msgid "Huh, will you look at that. It's got names, amounts,\\r\neverything."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1264_Kiryu"
msgid "Yeah. It says right here that the ten billion yen that got\\r\ntransferred from the Tojo to Kyohei Jingu back in 2005 was\\r\nmeant to get passed on to the Metropolitan Police."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1276_Tanimura"
msgid "That's the incident you were wrapped up in, right,\\r\nKiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1288_Kiryu"
msgid "Right."
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1300_Kiryu"
msgid "That missing cash nearly tore the clan apart. And the guy\\r\nbehind it all was a man named Kyohei Jingu. Haruka's father."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1312_Kiryu"
msgid "But there's more. There are notes on here detailing a police\\r\nplan to release inmates from Penitentiary No. 2 and create\\r\nartificial crime. All to make the police look good."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1324_Date"
msgid "That's one hell of a scoop."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1336_Tanimura"
msgid "No wonder they're so desperate to get it back. This goes\\r\npublic, all their dirty laundry'll be out in the open."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1348_Date"
msgid "So what's your next move?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1360_Kiryu"
msgid "We try and cut a deal with Katsuragi. I just need to figure\\r\nout how to get in touch with him."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1372_Tanimura"
msgid "I can help you with that. He and I have talked on the phone\\r\nbefore."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1384_Tanimura"
msgid "If you call from my cell, I'm sure he'll answer."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1396_Kiryu"
msgid "Huh. Mind if I borrow your phone, then?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1408_Tanimura"
msgid "Go right ahead."
msgstr "Sí..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1456_Akiyama"
msgid "Life's a cruel mistress sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1468_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure, you get used to the cheating and the backstabbing and\\r\nthe lying in my line of work."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1480_Akiyama"
msgid "But when it all smacks you in the face one after another... Oof."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1492_Date"
msgid "You seem like you're taking it pretty well, though."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1504_Date"
msgid "Most guys would go into total shock if they lost a hundred\\r\ngrand, let alone a hundred billion."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1516_Akiyama"
msgid "I am in shock. This is me in shock."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1528_Akiyama"
msgid "It's not that big of a deal, I know, but still."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1540_Date"
msgid "Not that big of a deal!?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1552_Akiyama"
msgid "I'll just make it all back again."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1564_Date"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Pero..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1576_Tanimura"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1588_Kiryu"
msgid "Heh."
msgstr "Je."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1600_Akiyama"
msgid "And hey, the week has had its highlights."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1612_Kiryu"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ya veo."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1624_Akiyama"
msgid "I met you for one, Kiryu-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1636_Kiryu"
msgid "Is that really so special?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1648_Akiyama"
msgid "You're my freaking hero, man. You saved my life."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1660_Kiryu"
msgid "Did I? I think I'd remember that."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1672_Akiyama"
msgid "Just listen. You know when the Millennium Tower blew up\\r\nfive years ago? When all that cash rained down on the city?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1684_Akiyama"
msgid "That day... changed my life. I grabbed as much as I could.\\r\nCleaned myself up. Went from homeless bum to this in practically no time flat."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1696_Akiyama"
msgid "If not for you, I'd still be out on the streets. Digging\\r\nthrough trash just to keep myself alive."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1708_Kiryu"
msgid "That's the money you built your business on, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1720_Akiyama"
msgid "Yup. Though now that I think about it..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1732_Akiyama"
msgid "That ten billion was probably the same cash my bank duped me\\r\ninto laundering for them before they had me take the fall."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1744_Kiryu"
msgid "The ten billion Jingu diverted to the Tojo Clan."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1756_Akiyama"
msgid "...So, yeah. This all feels kinda personal somehow."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1768_Akiyama"
msgid "If this stuff going down now is linked to that ten billion,\\r\nconsider me there."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1804_Akiyama"
msgid "I dunno about you guys, but this is starting to feel like fate to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1816_Akiyama"
msgid "Almost like we were all destined to end up here."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1828_Tanimura"
msgid "Fate?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1840_Date"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1852_Kiryu"
msgid "You might just be right..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1888_Date"
msgid "You really think that's how it went down?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1900_Akiyama"
msgid "Can't think of any other way. Me and Hana-chan are the only\\r\ntwo people who knew about the vault."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1912_Akiyama"
msgid "Kido-chan's the only other possibility."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1924_Kiryu"
msgid "What makes you say that?"
msgstr "¿Qué le hace decir eso?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1936_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, it would certainly wrap things up all nice and neat.\\r\nEverything would make sense."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1948_Kiryu"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "¿A qué te refieres?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1960_Akiyama"
msgid "Not long after Hana-chan saw him at the office, Kido-chan\\r\ngot hauled off by Hatsushiba Clan boys, who'd been working\\r\nwith the Shibata."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1972_Akiyama"
msgid "Just walked in and spirited him away. Simple. Clean."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1984_Kiryu"
msgid "What's so strange about that?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1996_Akiyama"
msgid "Everything. You'd understand if you've seen what Kido-chan\\r\ncan do in a fight."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2008_Date"
msgid "Go on."
msgstr "Dime."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2020_Akiyama"
msgid "Well, it's only been once I've witnessed it myself, but the\\r\nguy can mop the floor with anyone without even breaking a sweat."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2032_Akiyama"
msgid "He's pretty coy about it, though. Prefers to keep all that\\r\nunder wraps."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2044_Date"
msgid "How come?"
msgstr "¿Por qué?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2056_Kiryu"
msgid "It's better for the family that way."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2068_Akiyama"
msgid "Most likely. Kanemura Enterprises, where Kido-chan and\\r\nArai-san work, is a tiny speck under the big Shibata\\r\numbrella."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2080_Akiyama"
msgid "Now your usual yakuza outfit makes their living off those\\r\ndramatic displays of strength... but not Kanemura."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2092_Date"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr "¿Por qué no?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2104_Akiyama"
msgid "Didn't wanna stand out, especially with the rat race always\\r\ntearing this town apart. Guess that's just how he was."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2116_Tanimura"
msgid "Makes sense. It's safer to lay low and just get on with your\\r\nlife than to start bashing heads in."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2128_Akiyama"
msgid "Yup. Kanemura couldn't even afford his dues to the Shibata.\\r\nCame to me begging for a loan and everything."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2140_Akiyama"
msgid "Expanding his turf and inviting competition was probably the\\r\nlast thing on his mind."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2152_Kiryu"
msgid "I'm sure he was more than happy to keep his head down and\\r\nlet Kamurocho be Kamurocho."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2164_Akiyama"
msgid "For sure. That's why Arai-san and Kido-chan were so careful\\r\nnot to make any waves."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2176_Akiyama"
msgid "But yeah. Kido-chan's a monster."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2188_Date"
msgid "You think he let himself get kidnapped on purpose, then?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2200_Akiyama"
msgid "You bet I do. By the time I got back to the office that day,\\r\nhe was already gone."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2212_Akiyama"
msgid "The place was more of a mess than usual thanks to the\\r\n\"struggle.\" It was convincing, honestly. But one thing stood out to me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2224_Tanimura"
msgid "Which was what?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2236_Akiyama"
msgid "The order my books were in."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2248_Tanimura"
msgid "Your... books?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2260_Akiyama"
msgid "Yup. Kido-chan tossed a bunch of them around, probably to\\r\nmake it look like a fight went down. Cover his tracks, you\\r\nknow."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2272_Akiyama"
msgid "But the ones that were still on the shelf weren't in the\\r\nright spots for some reason. That's how I knew something was up."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2284_Tanimura"
msgid "Hold on. Your office isn't exactly what I'd call organized.\\r\nNot by a long shot."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2296_Tanimura"
msgid "Are you seriously telling me you know where every single\\r\nbook is supposed to be on your shelf?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2308_Akiyama"
msgid "Every single one."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2320_Tanimura"
msgid "Whoa..."
msgstr "Guau..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2332_Akiyama"
msgid "Long story short, my old pal Kido-chan pulled a fast one on\\r\nme."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2344_Date"
msgid "What I really wanna know is, who keeps a hundred billion in\\r\ncash just lying around in this day and age?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2356_Date"
msgid "Why not stash it in a bank?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2368_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't trust 'em. Besides, it's not like any of them pay\\r\ndecent interest anyway."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2380_Kiryu"
msgid "That much physical money isn't exactly portable, though. How\\r\ndid they get it all out?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2392_Akiyama"
msgid "Ask the \"DA\" guys who raided my office yesterday. They're\\r\nthe ones who did it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2404_Tanimura"
msgid "You think they were impostors?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2416_Akiyama"
msgid "Big time. Katsuragi must've sent them over once Kido-chan\\r\ntipped him off."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2428_Kiryu"
msgid "That would explain it."
msgstr ""

